{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BLACK FRIDAY OFFERS (templates/page.black-friday.json; review sheet templates/page.black-friday-preview.json)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Black Friday page: the player offer for everyone, and a stepped audiobook discount for existing customers.

No codes (owner, 30 Oct): the audiobook discount is three automatic discounts in Shopify (one per tier, minimum
quantity 1 / 3 / 5 on the hidden "BF 2026 individual audiobooks" collection, product type Audiobooks only, so bundles
never count), limited to the customer segment "BF 2026 existing customers" (at least one order). It comes off in the
basket while the customer is signed in. "Existing customer" here means the same thing: signed in with an order.
Goals beyond sales: get existing customers to sign in, and get new visitors onto the email list.

Phase, from the section's start and end settings (UK time, e.g. 2026-11-27T00:01:00+00:00):
- signed_out: the player offer, plus a locked "customer exclusive" card (no book discount shown) with a sign-in button
  that returns here; before the start, also an email sign-up for a reminder (Shopify customer form, tags below)
- not_eligible: signed in with no orders → the same locked card, without the sign-in button
- before: "Opens in" timer, the book tiers, "comes off automatically from [start] while you're signed in"
- during: "Live now · ends in" timer, tiers with the basket's tier lit, how many more reach the next tier, shop button
- ended: after the end time → refer a friend link
Colour follows the clock (bf--t-before / bf--t-during): orange panel before the start, black and cyan while live.
Player offer: the public player discount (50% off, for everyone) shown in every phase but ended, priced live from the
"Player" product (lowest variant price less "Player % off"). Display only: the discount is set up in Shopify.
Test bar ("Show the test bar", REMOVE BEFORE GO-LIVE): the page also renders hidden before / during / ended versions and
a fixed "Black Friday test" switch shows one at a time (choice kept for the browser session). The switch appears on a
preview (unpublished) theme, in the theme editor, or for customers tagged bf-test; never to others on the live theme.
The Live version counts down ~2.6 days.
"Preview state" forces a phase for design review only. Leave on "Live" on the real page.

Basket count: audiobooks (product type "Audiobooks"; bundles are "Audiobooks Bundle") in the cart at render time.
Clicks send vs_yoto_click { target } through data-vs-track: bf_sign_in, bf_signup, bf_shop, bf_player, bf_refer.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign forced = s.preview_state

  assign eligible = false
  if customer and customer.orders_count > 0
    assign eligible = true
  endif

  assign now_s = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign start_s = s.start_at | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign end_s = s.end_at | date: '%s' | plus: 0

  assign first_name = customer.first_name | default: s.preview_name | default: 'Hello'

  if now_s < start_s
    assign clock_phase = 'before'
  elsif now_s <= end_s
    assign clock_phase = 'during'
  else
    assign clock_phase = 'ended'
  endif

  if forced != 'live'
    assign real_phase = forced
  elsif customer == nil
    assign real_phase = 'signed_out'
  elsif eligible == false
    assign real_phase = 'not_eligible'
  else
    assign real_phase = clock_phase
  endif

  assign books = 0
  for item in cart.items
    if item.product.type == 'Audiobooks'
      assign books = books | plus: item.quantity
    endif
  endfor
  if forced == 'during' and books == 0
    assign books = 2
  endif

  assign t1 = s.tier1_min | default: 1
  assign t2 = s.tier2_min | default: 3
  assign t3 = s.tier3_min | default: 5
  assign pct = 0
  if books >= t3
    assign pct = s.tier3_pct
  elsif books >= t2
    assign pct = s.tier2_pct
  elsif books >= t1
    assign pct = s.tier1_pct
  endif

  assign shop_url = s.shop_url | default: '/collections/audiobooks'
  assign start_label = s.start_at | date: '%A %-d %B, %-I:%M%P'
  assign end_label = s.end_at | date: '%A %-d %B, %-I:%M%P'
  assign start_day = s.start_at | date: '%A %-d %B'
  if s.account_url != blank
    assign sign_in_url = s.account_url
  else
    assign return_path = request.path | url_encode
    assign sign_in_url = '/customer_authentication/login?return_to=' | append: return_path
  endif

  assign test_on = false
  if s.test_bar and forced == 'live'
    assign test_on = true
  endif
  assign real_key = ''
  if real_phase == 'before' or real_phase == 'during' or real_phase == 'ended'
    assign real_key = real_phase
  elsif real_phase == 'signed_out' or real_phase == 'not_eligible'
    assign real_key = clock_phase
  endif
  assign variants = 'real'
  if test_on
    for v in (1..3)
      case v
        when 1
          assign vname = 'before'
        when 2
          assign vname = 'during'
        else
          assign vname = 'ended'
      endcase
      if vname != real_key
        assign variants = variants | append: ',' | append: vname
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  assign variants = variants | split: ','
  assign test_tagged = false
  if customer and customer.tags contains 'bf-test'
    assign test_tagged = true
  endif
-%}

{%- for variant in variants -%}
{%- liquid
  if variant == 'real'
    assign phase = real_phase
    if forced == 'before' or forced == 'during'
      assign tphase = forced
    else
      assign tphase = clock_phase
    endif
  else
    assign phase = variant
    assign tphase = variant
    if variant != 'ended' and forced == 'live'
      if customer == nil
        assign phase = 'signed_out'
      elsif eligible == false
        assign phase = 'not_eligible'
      endif
    endif
  endif
  assign uid = section.id | append: '-' | append: variant
  assign key = variant
  if variant == 'real'
    assign key = real_key
  endif
  assign locked = false
  if phase == 'signed_out' or phase == 'not_eligible'
    assign locked = true
  endif

  assign timer_phase = ''
  if phase == 'before' or phase == 'during'
    assign timer_phase = phase
  elsif locked and tphase != 'ended'
    assign timer_phase = tphase
  endif
  if timer_phase == 'before'
    assign target_s = start_s
    assign target_iso = s.start_at
  else
    assign target_s = end_s
    assign target_iso = s.end_at
  endif
  if variant == 'during'
    assign target_s = now_s | plus: 223560
    assign target_iso = target_s | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S+00:00'
  endif
  assign left = target_s | minus: now_s
  if left < 0
    assign left = 0
  endif
  assign left_d = left | divided_by: 86400
  assign left_h = left | modulo: 86400 | divided_by: 3600
  assign left_m = left | modulo: 3600 | divided_by: 60
  assign left_x = left | modulo: 60
-%}
<section class="bf bf--{{ phase }} bf--t-{{ tphase }}" data-bf-phase="{{ phase }}" data-bf-variant="{{ variant }}" data-bf-key="{{ key }}"{% unless variant == 'real' %} hidden{% endunless %} {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="container">
    {%- if s.preview_label != blank and forced != 'live' -%}<p class="bf__review-label">{{ s.preview_label | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign quiet = false
      if phase == 'ended'
        assign quiet = true
      endif
      assign player = s.player_product
      assign show_player = false
      if s.show_player and player != blank and tphase != 'ended'
        assign show_player = true
      endif
      if player != blank
        assign player_off = 100 | minus: s.player_pct
        assign player_from = player.price_min | times: player_off | divided_by: 100
      endif
    -%}

    <div class="bf__panel{% if quiet %} bf__panel--quiet{% endif %}">
      {%- unless quiet -%}<span class="bf__backdrop" aria-hidden="true">Black Friday</span>{%- endunless -%}

      <div class="bf__top">
        <div class="bf__intro">
          <p class="bf__eyebrow">{% if phase == 'before' %}{{ s.eyebrow_before | escape }}{% elsif phase == 'signed_out' %}Black Friday{% else %}{{ s.eyebrow | replace: '[name]', first_name | escape }}{% endif %}</p>
          <h1 class="bf__title">
            {%- if phase == 'ended' -%}{{ s.ended_heading | escape }}
            {%- elsif phase == 'before' -%}{{ s.before_heading | escape }}
            {%- elsif locked -%}{% if tphase == 'before' %}{{ s.signed_out_before_heading | escape }}{% else %}{{ s.signed_out_heading | escape }}{% endif %}
            {%- else -%}{{ s.heading | escape }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </h1>
          {%- if phase == 'ended' -%}<p class="bf__lede">{{ s.ended_text | replace: '[end]', end_label | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if timer_phase != blank -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign reload = false
            if timer_phase == 'before' and forced == 'live' and variant == 'real'
              assign reload = true
            endif
          -%}
          {%- render 'black-friday-timer', phase: timer_phase, variant: variant, target_iso: target_iso, left_d: left_d, left_h: left_h, left_m: left_m, left_x: left_x, start_label: start_label, end_label: end_label, reload: reload -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- unless phase == 'ended' -%}
        <div class="bf-offers{% unless show_player %} bf-offers--single{% endunless %}">

          {%- if show_player -%}
            {%- render 'black-friday-player', cfg: s, player: player, player_from: player_from, phase: tphase, uid: uid -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if locked -%}
          {%- render 'black-friday-locked', cfg: s, uid: uid, mode: phase, sign_in_url: sign_in_url -%}
          {%- else -%}
          <article class="bf-offer bf-offer--books" aria-labelledby="bf-books-{{ uid }}">
            <p class="bf-offer__tag">Offer {% if show_player %}2{% else %}1{% endif %} · for you</p>
            <p class="bf-offer__big"><span class="bf-offer__upto">up to</span>{{ s.tier3_pct }}%<span class="bf-offer__off">off</span></p>
            <h2 class="bf-offer__name" id="bf-books-{{ uid }}">Audiobooks</h2>
            <div class="bf-offer__visual">
              <ol class="bf-ladder" aria-label="More audiobooks, bigger saving">
                {%- liquid
                  assign pcts = s.tier1_pct | append: ',' | append: s.tier2_pct | append: ',' | append: s.tier3_pct | split: ','
                  assign mins = t1 | append: ',' | append: t2 | append: ',' | append: t3 | split: ','
                  assign t2_last = t2 | minus: 1
                  assign t3_last = t3 | minus: 1
                  assign qtys = t1 | append: '–' | append: t2_last | append: '|' | append: t2 | append: '–' | append: t3_last | append: '|' | append: t3 | append: '+' | split: '|'
                -%}
                {%- for p in pcts -%}
                  {%- assign p_num = p | plus: 0 -%}
                  {%- assign n = mins[forloop.index0] | plus: 0 -%}
                  {%- assign is_active = false -%}
                  {%- if phase == 'during' and p_num == pct -%}{%- assign is_active = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <li class="bf-ladder__step bf-ladder__step--{{ forloop.index }}{% if is_active %} bf-ladder__step--active{% endif %}"{% if is_active %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>
                    <span class="bf-ladder__pct">{{ p }}%</span>
                    <span class="bf-ladder__books" aria-hidden="true">{%- for i in (1..n) -%}<i></i>{%- endfor -%}</span>
                    <span class="bf-ladder__qty">{{ qtys[forloop.index0] }} <span class="bf-ladder__unit">books</span></span>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ol>
            </div>
            <div class="bf-offer__action">
              {%- if phase == 'during' -%}
                <p class="bf-offer__nudge">
                  {%- if books == 0 -%}Basket: 0 audiobooks
                  {%- elsif books < t2 -%}{%- assign more = t2 | minus: books -%}Basket: {{ books }}. Add {{ more }} for {{ s.tier2_pct }}%
                  {%- elsif books < t3 -%}{%- assign more = t3 | minus: books -%}Basket: {{ books }}. Add {{ more }} for {{ s.tier3_pct }}%
                  {%- else -%}Basket: {{ books }}. Top saving
                  {%- endif -%}
                </p>
                <p class="bf-offer__auto">{{ s.auto_text | escape }}</p>
                <a class="bf-button" href="{{ shop_url }}" data-vs-track="bf_shop">{{ s.shop_text | escape }}</a>
              {%- else -%}
                <p class="bf-offer__auto">{{ s.auto_before_text | replace: '[start]', start_day | escape }}</p>
                <span class="bf-offer__soon">Opens {{ s.start_at | date: '%A' }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </article>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if phase == 'signed_out' and tphase == 'before' and s.show_signup -%}
          {%- assign form_id = 'bf-signup-' | append: uid -%}
          {%- form 'customer', id: form_id, class: 'bf-signup' -%}
            {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
              <p class="bf-signup__done" role="status">{{ s.signup_success | escape }}</p>
            {%- else -%}
              <div>
                <h2 class="bf-signup__title">{{ s.signup_heading | escape }}</h2>
                <p class="bf-signup__text">{{ s.signup_text | escape }}</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                {%- if form.errors -%}<p class="bf-signup__error" role="alert">{{ form.errors.translated_fields['email'] }} {{ form.errors.messages['email'] }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="{{ s.signup_tags | escape }}">
                <div class="bf-signup__row">
                  <label class="sr-only" for="{{ form_id }}-email">Email</label>
                  <input class="bf-signup__input" id="{{ form_id }}-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Your email" autocomplete="email" enterkeyhint="send" required>
                  <button type="submit" class="bf-button" data-vs-track="bf_signup">{{ s.signup_button | escape }}</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endform -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        <ul class="bf-chips" role="list">
          {%- unless locked -%}
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Applied while you're signed in</li>
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg>No code needed</li>
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h18l-2 12H5z"/><path d="M8 6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0"/></svg>Both offers in one basket</li>
          {%- endunless -%}
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>{{ s.start_at | date: '%a %-d' }} – {{ s.end_at | date: '%a %-d %b' }}</li>
        </ul>
        {%- if s.terms != blank -%}<div class="bf__terms">{{ s.terms }}</div>{%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="bf-code">
          <a class="bf-button" href="{{ s.refer_url }}" data-vs-track="bf_refer">Refer a friend</a>
        </div>
      {%- endunless -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endfor -%}

{%- if test_on -%}
  <div class="bf-testbar" data-bf-testbar data-tagged="{{ test_tagged }}" data-design="{{ request.design_mode }}" hidden>
    <span class="bf-testbar__label">Black Friday test</span>
    <div class="bf-testbar__buttons" role="group" aria-label="Show the page as">
      <button type="button" data-bf-show="before" aria-pressed="{% if real_key == 'before' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">Before</button>
      <button type="button" data-bf-show="during" aria-pressed="{% if real_key == 'during' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">Live</button>
      <button type="button" data-bf-show="ended" aria-pressed="{% if real_key == 'ended' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">After</button>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

<script>
  (function () {
    if (window.vbBfInit) return;
    window.vbBfInit = true;
    function pad(n) { return (n < 10 ? '0' : '') + n; }
    function tick() {
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-bf-timer]').forEach(function (el) {
        var target = Date.parse(el.getAttribute('data-target'));
        if (isNaN(target)) return;
        var left = Math.max(0, Math.floor((target - Date.now()) / 1000));
        var parts = { d: Math.floor(left / 86400), h: Math.floor((left % 86400) / 3600), m: Math.floor((left % 3600) / 60), s: left % 60 };
        el.querySelectorAll('[data-unit]').forEach(function (u) { u.textContent = pad(parts[u.getAttribute('data-unit')]); });
        if (left === 0 && el.hasAttribute('data-reload') && !el.dataset.reloading) {
          el.dataset.reloading = '1';
          setTimeout(function () { window.location.reload(); }, 1500);
        }
      });
    }
    tick();
    setInterval(tick, 1000);

    var bar = document.querySelector('[data-bf-testbar]');
    var role = window.Shopify && window.Shopify.theme && window.Shopify.theme.role;
    if (bar && (role && role !== 'main' || bar.getAttribute('data-tagged') === 'true' || bar.getAttribute('data-design') === 'true')) {
      bar.hidden = false;
      var show = function (name) {
        var target = document.querySelector('[data-bf-variant="' + name + '"]') || document.querySelector('[data-bf-variant="real"][data-bf-key="' + name + '"]') || document.querySelector('[data-bf-variant="real"]');
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-bf-variant]').forEach(function (el) { el.hidden = el !== target; });
        bar.querySelectorAll('[data-bf-show]').forEach(function (b) { b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.getAttribute('data-bf-show') === name)); });
        try { sessionStorage.setItem('vb-bf-test', name); } catch (e) {}
      };
      bar.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
        var b = event.target.closest('[data-bf-show]');
        if (b) show(b.getAttribute('data-bf-show'));
      });
      var saved = null;
      try { saved = sessionStorage.getItem('vb-bf-test'); } catch (e) {}
      if (saved) show(saved);
    }
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Black Friday offers",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "shopify-section--black-friday-code",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Dates (UK time)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "start_at", "label": "Opens", "default": "2026-11-27T00:01:00+00:00", "info": "Must match the start of the three BF 2026 audiobook discounts in Shopify." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "end_at", "label": "Ends", "default": "2026-11-30T23:59:00+00:00", "info": "Must match the end of the three BF 2026 audiobook discounts in Shopify." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Tiers" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier1_min", "label": "Tier 1 from (audiobooks)", "default": 1 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier1_pct", "label": "Tier 1 %", "default": 15 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier2_min", "label": "Tier 2 from (audiobooks)", "default": 3 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier2_pct", "label": "Tier 2 %", "default": 20 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier3_min", "label": "Tier 3 from (audiobooks)", "default": 5 },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier3_pct", "label": "Tier 3 %", "default": 25 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Copy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Black Friday · for [name]" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow_before", "label": "Eyebrow before it opens", "default": "Black Friday · coming soon" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading (H1)", "default": "2 offers for you" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "before_heading", "label": "Heading before it opens", "default": "2 Black Friday offers, coming soon" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signed_out_heading", "label": "Heading signed out", "default": "Black Friday: half price player" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signed_out_before_heading", "label": "Heading signed out, before it opens", "default": "Black Friday is coming" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "auto_before_text", "label": "Audiobook offer, before it opens", "default": "No code needed. From [start] it comes off automatically in your basket while you're signed in." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "auto_text", "label": "Audiobook offer, while live", "default": "No code needed. It comes off automatically in your basket while you're signed in." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "locked_heading", "label": "Customer card heading (signed out)", "default": "Customer exclusive" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "locked_text", "label": "Customer card text (signed out)", "default": "Ordered from us before? Sign in to see your offer. It comes off automatically in your basket while you're signed in." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "not_eligible_text", "label": "Customer card text (signed in, no orders yet)", "default": "This one is for customers who have ordered from us before." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sign_in_text", "label": "Sign-in button", "default": "Sign in to see your offer" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "account_url", "label": "Sign-in link", "info": "Leave empty to sign in and come back to this page." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shop_text", "label": "Shop button", "default": "Shop audiobooks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shop_url", "label": "Shop link", "default": "/collections/audiobooks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ended_heading", "label": "Heading after it ends", "default": "Black Friday has ended" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ended_text", "label": "Text after it ends", "default": "Our Black Friday offers ended on [end]. You can still earn rewards by recommending Voxblock to a friend." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "refer_url", "label": "Refer a friend link", "default": "/pages/refer-a-friend" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Email sign-up (player card)" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_signup", "label": "Show the sign-up", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "New to Voxblock? Get a reminder" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_text", "label": "Text", "default": "We'll email you when Black Friday opens, with the odd bit of news after. Unsubscribe any time." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_button", "label": "Button", "default": "Remind me" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_success", "label": "Thank you message", "default": "Thanks, you're on the list. We'll email you when it opens." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signup_tags", "label": "Customer tags", "default": "newsletter,bf-2026-signup", "info": "Added to the customer in Shopify, so the sign-ups can be found and emailed." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Player offer (for everyone)" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_player", "label": "Show the player offer", "default": true },
    { "type": "product", "id": "player_product", "label": "Player" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "player_pct", "label": "Player % off", "default": 50, "info": "Display only. The discount itself is set up in Shopify." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "player_heading", "label": "Player heading", "default": "The Voxblock player, [pct]% off" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "terms", "label": "Terms line" },
